{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-noisy-nap-v6.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "b9bb5cf72947f6ac4784678a806149c0ad3a45099dc22feda59f1455b4986f85",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9e2c11dbc8b0d7e11664bc9ddebbc0a829309c2c96da132daf6cf572fa4fb6a0",
      "text": "Sun Wukong’s\nNoisy Nap",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6631c110f1ce0ca4c30e2fa62f6b9695e671b419cba9646c72f32b0898ff3d9a",
      "text": "Sun Wukong yawned.\n“Time for a nap!”\nHe found a shady peach tree.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "259060a5f2e5ff20a5b10a3fddc9840beec0928f139ec63f539b56944d8d61a5",
      "text": "Pigsy brought a pillow.\n“Soft as a cloud!”\nThen his tummy went\nRUMBLE.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6176c7a2d8b5fe2e14455650b967cd1570921d074db37c1da6e299b43d924b46",
      "text": "“A snack first,” said Wukong.\nMunch, munch.\nPigsy’s tummy grew quiet.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "75c188f7b3e8e899610843f342f3dd84891bba2a08e3219e3b5c6ac71f3f7b31",
      "text": "Sandy waved a leaf fan.\nA leaf tickled Wukong’s nose.\n“Ah… ah… ACHOO!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6a90881de92dd40b752e2d0630de292848e3643854416027ccd2e79bbf77bfd6",
      "text": "A little bird sang a song.\n“TWEET! TWEET!”\nWukong sat up.\n“A little softer, please!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "216a938a0d8af7db7402516fbefe2539db8ccb66a18460e1c59fa94c90327b77",
      "text": "Pigsy chewed softly.\nSandy fanned slowly.\nThe bird sang, “Twee…\ntwee…”\nWukong smiled.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "285d6b54ae046666883387771efe52fd7960e4d519e7cfd4c1ce42855bf2b789",
      "text": "Wukong blew one tiny puff.\nA little cloud curled around\nhis feet.\n“Just right,” he whispered.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "58474f6df8337321effc815c6e6f3afc2e01c2f295f9a0ca8c8ee28efffbc0d2",
      "text": "Soon, his friends were sleepy\ntoo.\nPigsy snored. “Snrrr…”\nWukong gave one last giggle.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a5054d094b16c40a22cc9483b4b0440e101dc96e64d7892261398d1a5cb05028",
      "text": "Under the peach tree,\neveryone slept.\nThe leaves went hush.\nThe clouds drifted by.\nEven heroes need a nap.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b94c8febe5feb6a7e982144d0c240be01010efc5f336537724b56e5cfcd50ae",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.",
